Per pending check-run:
- runId = runIdOf(cr)
- if runId:
  - state = null; probeError = false
    try { state = resolveRun(runId) } catch (e) { probeError = true }
  - if probeError → live++, unknown++ (fail safe)
  - else if state === null → zombie reason 'no-run' (the run 404s — gh-842's live shape)
  - else:
    - st = lower(state.status)
    - active (queued/in_progress/waiting/pending/requested) → live
    - completed:
      - conclusion 'cancelled' → zombie 'cancelled'
      - other conclusion:
        - updated_at within postConclusionGraceMs (default 5 min) → live (check-run propagation lag)
        - else → zombie 'run-concluded'
    - other/unknown status → live (fail safe)
- else (no run id):
  - started = startedAtMs(cr)
  - if started !== null && nowMs - started > staleNoRunMs (default 30 min) → zombie 'stale-no-runner'
  - else → live (fresh stamp — the dispatch bridge just stamped it)

